Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:56:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Don't create undo steps when selecting segments

Selecting/deselecting segments is not an edit, so it now updates the
current history entry instead of adding an undo step. Previously every
selection change used up an undo step, so Ctrl+Z would undo a selection
instead of the last actual change.

Fork-Change: 05-undo-fixes
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
